Telosnex: in a classic Snap, keep the bubblewrap sandbox. WebKit treats any
Snap as confined and turns its sandbox off; a classic Snap is unconfined.
Uses the Snap's bwrap and xdg-dbus-proxy and mounts the Snap and core26
in the sandbox.

